{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"cannot_tell\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"preprint (which was not certified by peer review)\",\n    \"this version posted January 11, 2025. ; https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.01.10.632393 doi: bioRxiv preprint\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"To investigate this, we recorded gait and STN local field potential (LFP) activity in 38 PD patients, both Off and On dopamine medication.\",\n    \"Here, we investigated the specific link between STN neuronal activity recorded in the posterior and central STN areas, and gait/postural abilities, including FOG, in 38 PD patients.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"全文明确表明该文是2025年发布的bioRxiv预印本，并明确说明研究对38名帕金森病患者进行了STN局部场电位（LFP）与步态的同步研究。但是，全文没有出现PMID:23225012、PMID:40709562，也没有出现version_of字段或任何将该预印本关联到特定PubMed记录的说明。因此，仅凭全文无法判断报告所称的version_of关联是否错误，report_supported应为cannot_tell。指控者关于该研究是38人STN电生理研究、该文件是预印本的描述得到全文支持；但PMID:23225012是否对应2012年的一般性帕金森病章节，以及PMID:40709562是否对应这项研究，全文均未提供相关信息，无法核实。因此，指控者的整体描述为partly，而不能判定为全文明确支持。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6e49fda1-12c8-422b-bf40-7db5a806aae5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T200805809985Z", "elapsed_seconds": 44.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T20:08:50.624701+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "141e41879dbaac114700ea7a9c1849fc4fb5efea4e9b9e36d8e74e0085c9012a", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": 